      <rules>
        <rule name="Guardian Resonators" id="24b9-3d8c-2a9f-cc6f" hidden="false">
          <description>If this Admiral declares that they will Employ Guardian Generators (see the Guardian Generator (X) system) for a model that is within 15” of a friendly Ceylon Guardian Platform, they can re-roll any Exploding Strike results in the Resistance Roll, in addition to any Blank results.</description>
