        <rule name="Dark Hand" id="50df-69d0-bd29-3013" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per Round, provided a model from this unit is in the Play Area, this Battlefleet’s Admiral can automatically Deny a Valour Effect without discarding a card from their hand. 


