                  <description>Can only be purchased for a Crown Flagship unit.


Once per round, before this Admiral makes an Attack action with a Crown Ship unit, they may attempt to enact a Special Valour Effect with that unit.


If successful, the Effects of Disorder (see page 57 of the Dystopian Wars Rulebook) are ignored for the duration of the attack.</description>
                </rule>
