              <rules>
                <rule name="SABRE RATTLE" id="9d7a-399b-69be-9073" hidden="false">
                  <description>This Doctrine can only be purchased for an Indian Raj Flagship unit.


Each Indian Raj unit in this Admiral’s Force gains the Vanguard (5”) property.


When an Indian Raj unit in this Admiral’s Force makes a Vanguard Move, each of its models must end the move closer to the enemy Deployment Zone than it was at the start.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
